# Gift data for the /gift page -- local development only.
#
# Single-line JSON. One object per child: a first name, and that child's NJBEST
# Ugift code. The order here is the order they render on the page.
#
# In the cluster this value comes from Doppler, synced into a Kubernetes Secret
# by the Doppler operator and exposed to the container as GIFT_DATA. Doppler is
# the authoritative copy -- this file is only so `npm run dev` works locally.
#
# Copy to .env.local and replace the values. Never commit real data.
GIFT_DATA=[{"name":"Example","code":"AAA-000"},{"name":"Sample","code":"BBB-111"}]
